nd causes the Baker's to go  well fast forward three years to the  summer of 2017 for the main plot of  Resident Evil 7 which sees poor Ethan  winters encounter the charming Baker  family while he searches for his missing  wife Mia as Ethan enjoys the delightful  hospitality of the Baker's he soon  discovers that his wife and the family  have been infected with a mold like  fungus that turns them super aggressive  he escapes the hellish residence with  help from the Baker's daughter Zoe  defeating Jack and his wife margarita  along the way Ethan eventually discovers  that his wife Mia was working as an  operative for an organization that  developed the little girl known as  Evelyn into a bioweapon Evelyn's escaped  and well you know the rest of the story  Ethan finally encounters Evelyn faced a  giant face eventually killing her before  being rescued by none other than bold a  murderer Chris Redfield  the pair escaped in a helicopter with  Muir if you chose to cure her and they  fly off into the Sun right  wait is that an umbrella logo on the  side of that helicopter well sort of in  the wake of umbrellas messy end another  company known as blue umbrella  emerged from the ashes with the primary  goal to clean up the mess of the  original corporation in the wake of the  Baker residents outbreak Chris Redfield  assists blue umbrella in capturing Lucas  the last remaining Baker before he  reveals the secrets of Evelyn's  infection two nefarious ne'er-do-wells  / and there you go the resident evil  timeline in a hideous hideous nutshell  there are a couple of avenues of the  franchise that I didn't fully explore  like the Japanese CG movie trilogy or  the mediocre like gun games that came  out on the PlayStation 1 and 2 but if  you're a die-hard Resident Evil fan you  should definitely check them out I hope  you enjoyed this timeline and please let  me know your favorite Resident Evil game  in the comments section below and I'll  see you next time
 

